%B%command:%B% rem -- %B%level:%B% %LEVEL% -- %B%usage:%B% rem <id>
removes a whitelist or blacklist entry by ID.  if ID is unknown, use 'search' command.
%B%dronebl / ircbl:%B% rem ?chan? <dronebl|ircbl> <host|ip|last> <value1,value2..> [type]
removes from the RBL instead of a bot list.  [type] is the numeric class; omit it to use cfg(dronebl:type) or cfg(ircbl:type).